hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"958","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghulam mein apna hissa aazad kare, phir us ke paas maal ho jo ghulam ki qeemat ko pahunche, to ghulam ki insaf se qeemat lagayi jayegi. Phir wo apne shareekon ko un ke hisse dega aur us par aazad ho jayega. Warna us mein se jo aazad hua aazad hua."
"959","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam mein se tukda aazad kare to us par usے apne maal mein aazad karana lazim hai. Phir agar us ke paas maal na ho to ghulam ki insaf se qeemat lagayi jayegi. Phir us se kamayi karayi jayegi baghair us par sakhti kiye."
"960","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Barira un ke paas apni kitabat mein madad mangne aayi, jabke us ne apni kitabat mein se kuchh ada na kiya tha. Aisha ne us se kaha: Apne ghar walon ki taraf lauto. Phir agar wo pasand karein ke main tumhari kitabat ada karun aur tumhara wala mere liye ho to karungi. Phir Barira ne is ka apne ghar walon se zikr kiya to unhon ne inkar kiya. Aur unhon ne kaha: Agar wo chahe ke tum par ehsan kare to kare, aur tumhara wala hamare liye ho. Phir us ne is ka Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Khareedo aur aazad karo. Kyunke wala us ke liye hai jo aazad kare. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hue aur farmaya: Logon ka kya haal hai ke wo shartein lagate hain jo Allah ki kitab mein nahi hain? Jo aisi shart lagaye jo Allah ki kitab mein nahi to us ke liye nahi, agarche sau shartein lagaye. Allah ki shart zyada haq aur mazboot hai."
"961","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Barira mein teen sunnatein thein: Ek sunnat ye ke wo aazad ki gayi aur apne shohar mein ikhtiyar di gayi. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wala us ke liye hai jo aazad kare. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dakhil hue jabke handi gosht se ubal rahi thi. Phir Aap ke paas roti aur ghar ke saalan mein se saalan rakha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya main ne handi mein gosht nahi dekha? Unhon ne arz kiya: Kyun nahi. Lekin ye wo gosht hai jo Barira par sadqa kiya gaya tha, aur tum sadqa nahi khate. Aap ne farmaya: Us par sadqa hai aur hamare liye hadiya hai."
"962","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wala ki bai aur us ke hadiye se mana farmaya."
"963","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne eenton ke mimbar par khutba diya jabke Aap par talwar thi jis mein latki hui tehreer thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Hamare paas padhi jane wali kitab mein se Allah ki kitab aur jo is tehreer mein hai us ke siwa kuchh nahi. Phir use khola. Phir us mein oonton ke daant they. Aur us mein: Madina Ayr se falan tak haram hai. Phir jo us mein nayi cheez nikale us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai. Allah us se farz aur nafl qubool nahi farmayega. Aur us mein: Musalmanon ki panah ek hai, un ka adna use deta hai. Phir jo musalman ki panah tode us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai. Allah us se farz aur nafl qubool nahi farmayega. Aur us mein: Jo apne aaqaon ki ijazat ke baghair qaum se dosti kare us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai. Allah us se farz aur nafl qubool nahi farmayega."
"964","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs musalman jaan aazad kare, Allah us ke har hisse se us ka hissa Aag se bachayega."
